        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, it is important to our business that we ensure we have sufficient manufacturing capacity to meet our future production needs.",
        "start_character": 103576,
        "end_character": 103714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Across our Surgical portfolio, we sell a tiered offering of products intended to meet the specific needs of customers in markets around the world at different price points.",
        "start_character": 43483,
        "end_character": 43655
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 2025, we employed approximately 4,800 people to manufacture surgical products at nine facilities in the US, Belgium, Switzerland, Indonesia, Ireland and Germany and approximately 4,400 people to manufacture Vision Care products at seven facilities in the US, Germany, Singapore and Malaysia.",
        "start_character": 74738,
        "end_character": 75044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, we manufacture approximately 90% of our products internally and rely on third-party manufacturers for a limited number of products.",
        "start_character": 75374,
        "end_character": 75516
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, in research and development, we can apply our expertise in material and surface chemistry to develop innovative next-generation products for both our IOL and contact lens product lines.",
        "start_character": 7775,
        "end_character": 7973
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our contact lens and ocular health products, we typically compete in the premium price segments of the market and we use improvements in functionality, design and consumer convenience to maintain our pricing position over time.",
        "start_character": 56445,
        "end_character": 56676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we or our third-party manufacturers fail to comply fully with regulations, there could be a product recall or other shutdown or disruption of our production activities.",
        "start_character": 76729,
        "end_character": 76900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Vision Care, we are advancing new contact lens materials, coatings and designs to enhance visual performance, extend product lines and improve comfort.",
        "start_character": 26711,
        "end_character": 26865
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our in-house research and development capabilities, we also consider external innovation opportunities and routinely screen for companies developing emerging technologies that we believe could enhance our existing product offerings or develop into innovative new products.",
        "start_character": 18451,
        "end_character": 18738
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our need to comply with such regulations in connection with our direct activities, we also sell and provide goods, technology and services to agents, representatives and distributors who may export such items to customers and end-users.",
        "start_character": 102012,
        "end_character": 102263
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, they may gain a market advantage by developing and patenting competitive products or processes earlier than we can or by obtaining regulatory approvals / clearances or market registrations more rapidly than we can.",
        "start_character": 84328,
        "end_character": 84555
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001167379-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001167379-26-000014-18e238eeb4e1604f",
        "accession_number": "0001167379-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In countries where we do not have local operations or a scientific office, we use distributors to sell and handle the physical distribution of our products.",
